# Cloudflare static-asset headers (widget.fluentchat.ai / widget-staging.fluentchat.ai).
# Entry files keep fixed URLs, so browsers revalidate them on every load (a 304 when
# unchanged) and always run the latest release. Chunk names change with their content.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/chunks/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
